    <bpmn:sendTask camunda:asyncAfter="true" camunda:asyncBefore="true" camunda:expression="${true} " completionQuantity="1" id="VersturenEmailNotificatieTask" implementation="##WebService" isForCompensation="false" name="versturen e-mail notificatie" startQuantity="1">
                  
      
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
                        
        
        <camunda:inputOutput>
                              
          
